{"step_index":750,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-22T00:38:42Z","thinking":"**Analyzing Element Positioning**\n\nOkay, so I'm honing in on element positioning within the `#screen-new` div. I see that the `.screen` class is key here, and I'm currently investigating its `position` property. My intuition is telling me that if `.screen` *doesn't* have `position: relative`, then its `position: absolute` is going to look to its nearest positioned ancestor. That ancestor could very well be the `.main-content` element.\n\n\n**Refining Placement Strategy**\n\nOkay, I've had a breakthrough! Thinking through how the progress modal should overlay the interface, I've decided it must *not* block access to other navigation elements. Therefore, making it a direct child of `.main-content` is out, even though it covers ALL screens of `.main-content`, and leaving it as a child of `screen-new` is fine, since that's the screen we want to have it appear on. The user *needs* to be able to access those other areas while the process is running.\n\n\n**Defining Progress Presentation**\n\nI've shifted focus to user experience. The ideal progress indicator will be non-intrusive, a floating widget in the bottom-left. This way, users can monitor the process without their workflow being blocked. The concept is now a fixed-position element, something like a Toast, not a blocking modal. I am thinking of using CSS to ensure it's always accessible and visible, even when other elements are in focus.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Change progress modal to a non-blocking floating widget on the bottom left","EndLine":237,"Instruction":"Change progress-modal to a floating widget in the bottom left","ReplacementContent":"/* -------------------- PROGRESS WIDGET -------------------- */\n#progress-modal {\n    position: fixed; \n    bottom: 20px; \n    left: 20px; \n    width: 350px;\n    background: white; \n    z-index: 9998; \n    border-radius: 12px;\n    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    padding: 20px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n}\n#progress-modal .progress-box {\n    text-align: right;\n}\n#progress-modal h3 {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    margin-top: 0;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n}\n#progress-modal p {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    margin-bottom: 0;\n}","StartLine":222,"TargetContent":"/* -------------------- PROGRESS MODAL -------------------- */\n#progress-modal {\n    position: absolute; \n    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;\n    width: 100%; height: 100%; \n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85); \n    z-index: 9998; \n    align-items: center; \n    justify-content: center;\n    backdrop-filter: blur(5px);\n}\n#progress-modal .progress-box {\n    background: white; \n    padding: 40px; \n    border-radius: 20px; \n    max-width: 500px; \n    width: 90%; \n    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); \n    text-align: center;\n}","TargetFile":"d:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy\\desktop_app\\templates\\index.html","toolAction":"Convert modal to floating widget","toolSummary":"Floating progress widget"}}]}
